抱歉，大衛 但是她真的有需要知道這些

439
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:51,190
All right, but after this, I want to see you outside.
好的，但是之後 我要在外面跟你單挑

440
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:53,620
If it stops raining.
如果外面停止下雨的話

441
00:28:57,330 --> 00:29:00,990
You're the most incredible woman I've ever met.
你是我遇過最不可思議的女人

442
00:29:01,530 --> 00:29:06,470
How could I lose you? Now, I don't actually have a ring.
我怎麼能夠失去你呢？ 我現在並沒有戒指

443
00:29:06,670 --> 00:29:10,010
- I have a ring. - I wouldn't brag about that, big guy.
-我有戒指 -我不會在這時候炫耀，老兄

444
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:14,250
But, Phoebe..
但是，菲比…

445
00:29:15,080 --> 00:29:17,570
will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎？

446
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:22,440
No.
不

447
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:34,530
I love you, but I never needed a proposal from you.
我愛你，但是我從不需要你求婚

448
00:29:34,730 --> 00:29:37,200
I just needed to know we were headed somewhere.
我只需要知道我們之間是有發展的

449
00:29:37,400 --> 00:29:42,400
- That we had a future. - We can have any future you want.
-我們是有未來的 -我們可以有任何你想要的未來

450
00:29:50,220 --> 00:29:53,210
Okay, well, I'm gonna take off.
好的，我要走了

451
00:29:53,620 --> 00:29:56,180
David, I'm so sorry. I'm sorry.
大衛，我很抱歉，我好抱歉

452
00:29:56,360 --> 00:30:00,380
Just so I know, if I had asked first..?
讓我知道一下，如果我先問了？

453
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:06,120
Yeah, I might have said yes, but that would've been wrong.
我有可能會答應，但是那是不對的

454
00:30:07,130 --> 00:30:09,190
Please, you don't have to explain.
你不用解釋，沒關係

455
00:30:09,370 --> 00:30:12,270
I mean, perhaps if I hadn't gone to Minsk..
我是說 如果我當初沒有去明斯克…

456
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:17,400
things would have worked out for us, and I wouldn't have ruined my career.
我們之間可能就沒問題了 而我也不會毀了我的事業

457
00:30:17,580 --> 00:30:20,810
Or lost that toe to frostbite.
或是因凍瘡而失去那隻腳趾

458
00:30:21,380 --> 00:30:22,910
It was a good trip.
那是趟好旅程

459
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:31,450
- Is it okay if I hug you now? - Oh, yes.
-我現在可以擁抱你嗎？ -喔，可以

460
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:38,090
Because of our meddling! All right?
就是因為我們的多管閒事，好嗎？

461
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:49,870
Oh, isn't this nice? It's so quiet. I could just lie here all day.
這樣不是很好嗎？如此安靜 我可以整天都躺在這裡

462
00:30:50,040 --> 00:30:52,310
Oh, I know.
我知道

463
00:30:53,510 --> 00:30:58,470
- Open your drapes! Open your drapes! - So glad we got adjoining rooms.
-打開窗簾！打開窗簾！ -我們的房間是相通的還真不錯呢

464
00:30:59,650 --> 00:31:04,250
- The sun is out! - Hey! Remember when I had corneas?
-太陽出來了！ -嘿！記得我看得到的時候嗎？

465
00:31:04,460 --> 00:31:05,950
Go to the pool and reserve chairs.
趕快去游泳池佔位子

466
00:31:06,290 --> 00:31:10,660
- I will get the magazines and the lotion. - Ladies? Ross' speech is in 45 minutes.
-我會拿雜誌跟防曬乳液 -羅斯的演講再四十五分就開始了

467
00:31:10,830 --> 00:31:12,730
- No! - Damn it!
-不！ -該死的！

468
00:31:13,730 --> 00:31:16,400
Walls are pretty thin, guys.
牆壁很薄的，你們這些人

469
00:31:22,080 --> 00:31:27,100
"Then we have to weigh the data from recent MRI scans and DNA testing..
我們必須考量最近磁共振造影資料 與去氧核糖核酸測試資料…

470
00:31:28,010 --> 00:31:33,250
which call into question information gathered from years of carbon dating."
而這些對多年來的碳年代 測定資料收集方式形成了一些疑點

471
00:31:33,490 --> 00:31:37,220
Look at the woman sitting out by the pool getting tan.
瞧瞧那個坐在游泳池畔 享受日光浴的女人

472
00:31:37,390 --> 00:31:41,090
She's all leathery and wrinkled. I'm so jealous!
她的皮都有皺紋了，我真是忌妒！

473
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:45,620
"Finally, factor in the profusion of new species recently discovered.
最後， 最近有許多豐富新物種的發現

474
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:48,030
Giganotosaurus.
巨獸龍

475
00:31:48,700 --> 00:31:52,430
- Argentinosaurus." - Not to mention Coldsaurus.
-阿根廷龍 -更不用提冷龍

476
00:31:55,410 --> 00:31:59,310
"And that's just the herbivores. I'm not even gonna discuss the carnivores.
而這些只是草食性的 我還沒有要提到肉食性的

477
00:31:59,510 --> 00:32:01,140
Their heads are already too big.
他們的頭都已經是太大了

478
00:32:01,310 --> 00:32:05,270
Which is ironic, considering their stunted cerebral development."
這是蠻諷刺的 因為他們的大腦卻是發育不良的

479
00:32:09,790 --> 00:32:11,120
Really?
真的嗎？

480
00:32:13,430 --> 00:32:16,400
"But all kidding aside, in much the same way..
但是撇開玩笑不談，這是相同於…

481
00:32:16,560 --> 00:32:21,470
that Homo ergaster is thought to be a separate species from Homo erectus.."
匠人曾被認為是直立人（音近勃起）的 另一個分支

482
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:28,340
- What? - He said "erectus."
-什麼？ -他說「直立人」

483
00:32:28,540 --> 00:32:32,980
- You're kidding, right? - No, he really said it.
-你在開玩笑嗎？ -不，他是真的那樣說

484
00:32:34,050 --> 00:32:36,640
"And while there are certainly vast differences..
而當然有許多很大的差異…

485
00:32:36,820 --> 00:32:41,650
between these Mesozoic fossils and the example of Homo erectus.."
介於這些中生代化石 跟此直立人例子

486
00:32:44,260 --> 00:32:45,620
Erectus?
勃起？

487
00:32:45,790 --> 00:32:48,120
- Homo. - Right.
-同性戀（音同人屬） -沒錯

488
00:32:49,760 --> 00:32:55,790
"In a very real way, we can bring the Mesozoic Era into the 21st century."
「已非常真實的方式，我們可以 將中生代時期帶入二十一世紀」

489
00:32:55,970 --> 00:32:58,130
Thank you.
謝謝

490
00:33:04,140 --> 00:33:06,040
- Really great. - Oh, thanks, guys.
-真的很棒 -謝謝你們

491
00:33:06,210 --> 00:33:11,510
I thought it was wonderful. Jarvis Oberblau. Cornell.
我認為很精采，我是傑維斯歐伯勞 康乃爾大學

492
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:17,490
I mean, the ideas you put forth, and from someone so young and..
你突顯出來的議題 尤其是你是這樣的年輕而且…

493
00:33:22,830 --> 00:33:25,820
Okay, now we're just holding hands.
好的，現在我們只是在握著手

494
00:33:26,130 --> 00:33:30,000
Alrighty. We're gonna hit the beach. That was really great.
好的，我們要去海灘了 演講真的很棒

495
00:33:30,170 --> 00:33:32,830
- Oh, thank you. - Yeah. Oh, and so funny.
-謝謝 -是啊，而且很有趣

496
00:33:34,340 --> 00:33:37,210
- Take it easy. - All right, thanks. Thanks so much.
-放輕鬆點 -好的，謝謝，非常謝謝

497
00:33:37,380 --> 00:33:40,010
I can't tell you how much it means that you were here.
我無法告訴你 你們在此對我意義有多大

498
00:33:40,180 --> 00:33:42,110
You kidding? We wouldn't have missed it.
你在開玩笑嗎？我們不可能會錯過的

499
00:33:45,820 --> 00:33:47,410
I'm back.
我回來了

500
00:33:48,120 --> 00:33:51,350
Okay. Well, excuse me?
好的，失陪一下好嗎？

501
00:33:53,630 --> 00:33:55,320
- Well? - You were incredible.
-怎麼樣？ -你真是不可思議

502
00:33:55,500 --> 00:33:56,890
You blew them away.
你完全迷住了他們了

503
00:33:57,130 --> 00:34:01,000
I can't tell you how great it was to look in the crowd and see your face.
我無法告訴你在人群中 看到你的臉有多棒

504
00:34:01,170 --> 00:34:04,760
I mean, did you know you were mouthing the words along with me?
我是說 你知道你嘴巴在跟著我念嗎？

505
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,560
- I was not. - No, it's okay.
-我沒有 -不，沒關係

506
00:34:06,770 --> 00:34:09,740
It made me feel like a rock star.
那讓我覺得很像搖滾巨星

507
00:34:10,080 --> 00:34:13,140
Oh, my God. I'm your groupie.
我的天啊 我跟你研究的東西是一樣的

508
00:34:13,510 --> 00:34:16,410
Hey, I better not find you naked in my hotel room.
我最好不要在房間裡 發現你脫光光喔

509
00:34:20,650 --> 00:34:22,750
Look, I took it too far.
哎呀，我又扯太遠了

510
00:34:27,090 --> 00:34:29,290
Hey, I thought you were going to the beach.
我以為你要去海灘

511
00:34:29,460 --> 00:34:32,020
- It's raining again. - What?
-又在下雨了 -什麼？

512
00:34:32,200 --> 00:34:33,830
Would you look at that.
你瞧瞧吧

513
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:36,590
The only time the sun comes out the whole weekend..
這星期以來 唯一有太陽的時候…

514
00:34:36,770 --> 00:34:39,830
is the one hour I'm giving my speech.
就是我在演講的那個小時

515
00:34:40,010 --> 00:34:42,100
Someone up there likes me.
那上頭的某人還真喜歡我

516
00:34:43,980 --> 00:34:46,950
But people down here are pissed.
但是下面的一些人都氣死了

517
00:34:53,790 --> 00:34:56,810
I can't believe it's raining again. It's so unfair.
我不敢相信又在下雨了，真是不公平

518
00:34:56,990 --> 00:34:59,790
Well, on the bright side, now we won't have to see..
往好處想就是我們不用看到…

519
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:03,420
all these paleontologists with their shirts off.
那些古生物學家脫掉上衣

520
00:35:05,470 --> 00:35:07,700
Not you guys.
不是你們

521
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:10,660
You've got it going on.
你們還不錯

522
00:35:14,070 --> 00:35:16,770
- What will we do today? - They have a game room downstairs.
-我們今天要做什麼呢？ -他們樓下有遊戲間

523
00:35:16,940 --> 00:35:18,470
They have Ping-Pong and stuff.
有兵乓球還有其他的東西

524
00:35:18,680 --> 00:35:20,540
Ping-Pong? Honey, they have Ping-Pong.
乒乓球？親愛的，他們有乒乓球耶

525
00:35:20,710 --> 00:35:23,110
- Let's play. - I don't think so.
-我們來玩 -我想不好

526
00:35:24,450 --> 00:35:26,610
- Why not? - You know how competitive you get.
-為什麼不要？ -你知道你得失心很重的

527
00:35:26,790 --> 00:35:29,880
And while I say it's cute, others disagree, and I'm lying.
我以前說那樣很可愛，可是 別人都不同意，而且我在說謊

528
00:35:31,660 --> 00:35:34,420
- I'm not always that bad. - Oh, yeah?
-我又不是永遠都那樣糟糕 -是嗎？

529
00:35:34,590 --> 00:35:37,030
What happened when we played last time?
我們上次玩的時候發生什麼事呢？

530
00:35:37,200 --> 00:35:39,600
I punched you.
我揍了你

531
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:42,600
- And? - Phoebe.
-還有呢？ -還有菲比

532
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:46,840
- And? - I clunked your heads together.
-還有呢？ -我把你們的頭撞在一起

533
00:36:06,390 --> 00:36:07,860
- There you are. - Hey. Listen.
-你在這裡 -嘿，聽著

534
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:11,660
As soon as it stops raining, we have got to go snorkeling.
只要一停止下雨 我們一定要去浮潛

535
00:36:11,860 --> 00:36:15,560
Some kid told me about this sea turtle. If you blow bubbles in his face..
有個小孩告訴我有海龜 如果你對著他的臉吹氣泡…

536
00:36:15,740 --> 00:36:18,140
he chases you.
他會追著你跑喔

537
00:36:18,340 --> 00:36:22,770
I'm sorry, I can't. I'm running a discussion group all afternoon.
我很抱歉，我不能去 我整個下午都要主持一個討論組

538
00:36:22,940 --> 00:36:25,570
That's okay. I'll find someone else to do it.
沒關係，我找別人去好了

539
00:36:25,780 --> 00:36:27,580
I'd do it alone, but..
我是可以一個人去，但是…

540
00:36:27,750 --> 00:36:31,240
I don't know what happens if the sea turtle catches you.
我不知道海龜 如果抓到我會發生什麼事

541
00:36:32,050 --> 00:36:34,110
You know, I feel so bad.
我覺得很糟糕

542
00:36:34,290 --> 00:36:37,190
I haven't seen you this whole trip. Especially last night..
我整趟旅途都沒有跟你在一起 尤其是昨晚…

543
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:40,790
Don't worry about it. It was fine. I had the best time with Rachel.
不用擔心，沒關係 我跟瑞秋玩的很開心

544
00:36:40,960 --> 00:36:44,920
I just felt bad for you, stuck in that room working on Ross' speech.
我只是為你難過 跟羅斯關在房間裡趕演講稿

545
00:36:45,100 --> 00:36:48,190
Actually, it turned out to be a lot of fun.
事實上，結果還蠻好玩的

546
00:36:48,970 --> 00:36:52,870
Oh, well, at least we're both having fun, right?
那至少我們都過得很愉快，不是嗎？

547
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:57,180
- Is it weird that it's not with each other? - Yeah.
-我們不在一起卻很快樂，很怪吧？ -是啊

548
00:36:57,340 --> 00:36:59,040
A little bit, yeah.
有一點，是啊

549
00:37:03,820 --> 00:37:06,180
I think we need to talk.
我想我們需要談談

550
00:37:07,250 --> 00:37:10,120
Yeah, I think we do.
是啊，我想我們是需要

551
00:37:12,930 --> 00:37:14,390
About what?
談什麼呢？

552
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:20,260
- Come on, you guys, it'll be fun! - All right.
-別這樣，會很好玩的啦！ -好啦

553
00:37:20,430 --> 00:37:24,200
- I'll play if we don't keep score. - Well, then how do we know who wins?
-不計分我才要玩 -那我們怎麼知道誰贏呢？

554
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:30,030
- Nobody wins. - So we're just four losers. Super.
-沒有人會贏 -所以我們是四個輸家，太好了

555
00:37:31,080 --> 00:37:33,600
- Well, I'm not playing with her. - I'm out.
-我不要跟她玩 -我不要玩了

556
00:37:33,780 --> 00:37:35,680
- I'll play you. - Okay.
-我跟你玩 -好的

557
00:37:35,850 --> 00:37:38,410
- You don't know what you're doing. - She gets crazy.
-你不知道你在做什麼 -她會很瘋狂的

558
00:37:38,580 --> 00:37:41,210
This scar? That's from Pictionary.
這個疤痕是從猜字遊戲來的

559
00:37:43,290 --> 00:37:44,880
I think I'll be all right.
我想我會沒事的

560
00:37:45,060 --> 00:37:48,890
- You want to volley a bit for serve? - Sure, if you want to.
-你想要先熱身一下嗎？ -當然，如果你想要的話

561
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:58,440
Oh, by the way, I'm awesome.
對了，我很厲害的

562
00:38:00,970 --> 00:38:03,240
Oh, dear God, there's two of them.
親愛的上帝，他們倆是一樣的

563
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:06,010
- You ready to play? - Hell, yeah.
-你準備好要玩了嗎？ -當然了

564
00:38:06,250 --> 00:38:11,980
- Did you know this about him? - No idea. I thought he was soft like you.
-你有看過他這一面嗎？ -沒有，我以為他跟你一樣軟弱

565
00:38:12,350 --> 00:38:15,010
- Want to make it more interesting? - How much you thinking?
-想要更好玩點嗎？ -你想要多少呢？

566
00:38:15,250 --> 00:38:17,020
- Ten bucks a game? - Make it 50.
-十塊錢一局嗎？ -加到五十塊錢好了

567
00:38:17,260 --> 00:38:18,810
- I'll make it 100. - One thousand..
-我加到一百塊錢 -一千…

568
00:38:19,030 --> 00:38:20,960
Okay!
好了！

569
00:38:21,660 --> 00:38:24,150
We'll flip to see who goes first. You got a quarter?
我們擲銅板來決定誰先開球 你有銅板嗎？

570
00:38:24,460 --> 00:38:27,330
No. Either of you girls got a quarter?
沒有，你們兩個女生誰有銅板呢？

571
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:31,130
Honey, try to focus the trash talk on him.
親愛的，把這種罵人的話 都用到他身上

572
00:38:32,510 --> 00:38:35,770
- Monica, you call it. - Heads. No, tails! Heads!
-摩妮卡，你來猜 -正面，不，背面！正面！

573
00:38:35,980 --> 00:38:38,380
- Tails. - Oh, what are the chances?
-背面 -機率有這樣低嗎？

574
00:38:43,480 --> 00:38:45,280
- My point! - Oh, no, I don't think so.
-我得分！ -不，我可不這麼認為

575
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:49,180
Standard rules: If at any time a player uses his nonracket-bearing hand..
根據標準法規定，若參賽者 在任何時間將沒握球拍的手…

576
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:52,380
to touch the playing surface, he or she forfeits the point.
碰觸到球桌表面，將不算得分

577
00:38:55,900 --> 00:38:57,890
He was a lawyer.
他曾經是律師

578
00:38:59,800 --> 00:39:02,060
All the East Coast is having beautiful weather.
東岸的天氣十分良好

579
00:39:02,300 --> 00:39:04,290
In New York, it's 72 and sunny.
在紐約是華氏七十二度 而且陽光普照

580
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:06,970
Weather bitch.
氣象婊子

581
00:39:09,140 --> 00:39:10,800
It's open.
門沒鎖

582
00:39:12,080 --> 00:39:13,550
- Hi, Joe. - Hey.
-嗨，喬伊 -嘿

583
00:39:14,050 --> 00:39:17,980
- What? Is everything okay? - Charlie and I broke up.
-怎麼了？一切都還好嗎？ -查莉跟我分手了

584
00:39:18,180 --> 00:39:20,240
No. Why?
不，為什麼？

585
00:39:20,490 --> 00:39:23,220
Well, she said we have nothing in common.
嗯，她說我們沒有任何共同點

586
00:39:23,420 --> 00:39:25,360
That's crazy.
這真是胡說

587
00:39:25,930 --> 00:39:28,160
No, it's not. We have nothing in common.
不，是真的，我們沒有任何共同點

588
00:39:29,230 --> 00:39:31,490
- Yeah, that's true. - Yeah.
-是啊，沒錯 -是啊

589
00:39:31,700 --> 00:39:34,690
I mean, she should be with someone more like Ross.
她應該跟像是羅斯那樣的人在一起

590
00:39:34,870 --> 00:39:38,170
You know, I mean he uses all those big words too.
你知道的 他也會用那些很難的字眼

591
00:39:38,340 --> 00:39:42,270
- Man, smart people are dull. - Well, hey!
-天啊，聰明的人真是無趣 -嗯，是啊！

592
00:39:42,510 --> 00:39:44,740
Okay, Rach.
好了，瑞秋

593
00:39:45,880 --> 00:39:51,780
I feel so stupid, you know? Why do I keep going after the wrong girls?
我覺得好蠢，你知道嗎？為什麼我一直 都喜歡不適合我的女生呢？

594
00:39:52,020 --> 00:39:54,610
- What are you talking about? - Oh, come on.
-你在說什麼呢？ -喔，少來了

595
00:39:54,790 --> 00:40:00,230
I mean, there's you, then there's Charlie. It's like.. What the hell's my problem?
我是說，有你，然後是查莉 這就像是…我到底是哪根筋不對呢？

596
00:40:00,390 --> 00:40:02,520
I just..
我只是…

597
00:40:06,370 --> 00:40:12,270
Okay. Maybe you're not always going after the wrong girl.
或許你並沒有都跟 不適合你的女生一起

598
00:40:12,470 --> 00:40:15,530
I'm telling you, Rach, Charlie is not right for me.
我告訴你，瑞秋 查莉並不適合我

599
00:40:15,740 --> 00:40:18,730
- I'm not talking about her. - Well, then, who?
-我不是在說她 -是喔，那是誰呢？

600
00:40:18,910 --> 00:40:21,680
The waitress I went out with last month?
那個我上個月約過的女服務生嗎？

601
00:40:22,950 --> 00:40:25,040
- You know what? Forget it. - No, no, no, no.
-你知道嗎？算了 -不…

602
00:40:25,220 --> 00:40:27,580
- Who are you talking about? - No, I don't..
-你是在說誰呢？ -不，我不…

603
00:40:27,750 --> 00:40:30,620
I actually don't know who I'm talking about, so..
事實上我並不知道 我在說什麼，所以…

604
00:40:31,060 --> 00:40:33,120
- Okay. - Yeah.
-好的 -嗯

605
00:40:33,290 --> 00:40:36,190
Well, I'm gonna go see if I can get a room for tonight.
我要去看看有沒有辦法 再訂到另一間房間

606
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:40,090
- And I'll see you later. - Yeah, sure. Okay.
-待會見 -是啊，好的

607
00:41:02,690 --> 00:41:05,180
- You like me? - Okay.
-你喜歡我？ -好吧

608
00:41:05,390 --> 00:41:08,490
- Let's not make a big thing about this. - It's a huge thing!
-我們不要過度渲染這件事 -這是一件大事！

609
00:41:08,690 --> 00:41:10,860
Okay, not working with me, Joe.
你很不合作喔，喬伊

610
00:41:11,230 --> 00:41:16,500
Look, here's the thing. Lately, I have been having thoughts.
聽著，事情事這樣的 最近，我有些想法

611
00:41:16,870 --> 00:41:19,000
Musings, if you will.
應該說是冥想

612
00:41:20,340 --> 00:41:22,770
- Well, for how long? - Oh, only like a month.
-多久了呢？ -大概只有一個月

613
00:41:23,010 --> 00:41:24,670
- A month? - Well..
-一個月？ -嗯…

614
00:41:24,880 --> 00:41:30,370
Dial it down. Listen, maybe they're crazy thoughts, but sometimes I do.
小聲點，或許只是一些瘋狂的想法 但是有時候我就是會想啊

615
00:41:30,580 --> 00:41:34,020
I have been thinking about, you know, us.
我一直在想我們之間的可能性

616
00:41:35,960 --> 00:41:39,080
- Okay, dial it up a little. - Oh, you're right. Okay.
-好的，現在音調提高一點 -你說的對，好的

617
00:41:39,260 --> 00:41:40,780
- I just have a question. - Shoot.
-我只有一個問題 -該死

618
00:41:41,030 --> 00:41:44,430
- What the hell are you doing? - I'm not trying to do anything.
-你倒底是在做什麼？ -我試著不要做任何事

619
00:41:44,600 --> 00:41:47,930
It's just, we have such a good time when we're together, you know?
只是當我們在一起時非常地快樂 你知道嗎？

620
00:41:48,100 --> 00:41:52,370
And I mean, aren't you just a little curious what it would be like?
你難道都沒有好奇過 那會是怎樣嗎？

621
00:41:52,570 --> 00:41:56,510
Am I curious? I mean, I'm as curious as..
我好奇過？我就跟…

622
00:41:56,910 --> 00:41:59,100
George!
喬治一樣好奇！

623
00:42:00,780 --> 00:42:03,110
- Who? - Curious George!
-誰？ -好奇喬治阿！

624
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:06,050
You know, the monkey and the guy with the yellow hat.
那隻猴子還有那個戴黃帽的男人

625
00:42:06,250 --> 00:42:08,650
- Of course. I remember. - He had a paper route.
-我當然記得 -他還有個紙路線圖

626
00:42:08,820 --> 00:42:10,650
Yeah, he did.
是啊，沒錯

627
00:42:10,890 --> 00:42:14,330
- See, this is what I'm talking about. - No, I know. We're great!
-這就是我說的 -我知道，我們棒透了！

628
00:42:14,530 --> 00:42:17,260
But, Rach, no, this can't happen.
但是瑞秋，不，不能這樣的

629
00:42:17,460 --> 00:42:21,400
Can't it just happen a little bit?
不能有一點點機會嗎？

630
00:42:23,670 --> 00:42:26,930
- No! It can't happen at all! - Why not?
-不！一點也不行 -為什麼不行？

631
00:42:27,110 --> 00:42:30,800
Because, look, no one wants this to happen more than me, okay?
我最希望事情是這樣了，好嗎？

632
00:42:30,980 --> 00:42:34,410
I have gone over this moment in my head 100 times..
我在我腦海中已經幻想過 這情節一百次了

633
00:42:34,580 --> 00:42:37,950
and not once did I ever say no.
而且我從沒拒絕過

634
00:42:41,620 --> 00:42:44,610
I couldn't do it to Ross.
我不能這樣對羅斯

635
00:42:45,620 --> 00:42:48,290
- But that wasn't gonna stop you before. - I know. I know..
-但之前卻不是這樣 -我知道…

636
00:42:48,460 --> 00:42:53,990
but I've thought about it a lot since then, and it just wouldn't be right.
但是在那之後我想了很多 這是不對的

637
00:42:56,840 --> 00:42:58,270
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

638
00:43:00,810 --> 00:43:03,270
I'm sorry too.
我也很抱歉

639
00:43:04,580 --> 00:43:07,010
- Oh, God, I shouldn't have said anything. - No, no.
-天啊，我不應該說出來的 -不…

640
00:43:07,180 --> 00:43:09,200
No, no, no, no. Hey, we'll be fine.
別這樣，我們沒事的

641
00:43:09,380 --> 00:43:12,110
- Like you said, it's no big deal. - It's not a big deal.
-就像你所說的，這沒有什麼 -沒錯

642
00:43:12,320 --> 00:43:14,290
- No big deal. - It's so not a big deal.
-沒有什麼 -真的是沒有什麼

643
00:43:14,490 --> 00:43:17,850
- I'll see you later. All right, hey. - Okay, great.
-待會見，好囉 -好的，太好了

644
00:43:37,380 --> 00:43:39,400
Okay..
好的…

645
00:43:51,990 --> 00:43:56,390
Oh, I'm sorry, I think.. I think that may have missed the table.
真抱歉喔，我想… 我想那可能沒有碰到桌面

646
00:43:56,660 --> 00:43:58,320
- Oh, do you? - Yeah.
-是嗎？ -是的

647
00:43:58,530 --> 00:43:59,660
- Do you? - Yeah.
-是嗎？ -是的

648
00:43:59,870 --> 00:44:01,660
- Do you? - Yeah!
-是嗎？ -是的！

649
00:44:02,500 --> 00:44:05,800
- You really find this attractive on him? - Oh, yeah.
-你真的認為他這樣很有魅力嗎？ -是的

650
00:44:06,010 --> 00:44:09,910
Are you telling me you're not even a little turned on by Monica right now?
你要告訴我你現在沒有 被摩妮卡撩的心癢癢的？

651
00:44:16,220 --> 00:44:20,240
This is the first time in our marriage that I've felt like the more attractive one.
這是婚後我第一次覺得 我是比較有魅力的那一個

652
00:44:21,050 --> 00:44:23,420
All right, come on, Mike. You can beat her.
好了，加油，麥克，你可以打敗她的

653
00:44:23,660 --> 00:44:26,120
Knock that dog off her head.
把她打的落花流水

654
00:44:29,190 --> 00:44:32,130
- Damn it! - I sleep with him!
-該死的！ -我跟他上床喔！

655
00:44:34,130 --> 00:44:36,500
- Game point. - Don't get too cocky.
-關鍵點 -別太驕傲

656
00:44:36,670 --> 00:44:38,190
Remember, I won the last one.
記住上次是我贏的

657
00:44:38,370 --> 00:44:41,500
Oh, by the way, how did that feel, losing to a girl?
喔，對了 輸給一個女生感覺如何呢？

658
00:44:41,710 --> 00:44:44,640
You should look in the mirror before you call yourself that.
你應該先照照鏡子再這樣說

659
00:44:49,050 --> 00:44:52,510
- No! No! No! - And that's how it's done.
-不！不！不！ -而就是這樣結束了

660
00:44:53,150 --> 00:44:54,410
Okey-dokey.
好了

661
00:44:54,650 --> 00:44:58,610
You've each won a game, and I've lost what's felt like a year of my life.
你們都各贏了一局 而我感覺好像是失去了一年的生命

662
00:44:58,790 --> 00:45:00,690
Everybody goes home a winner.
每個人都可以跟一個贏家回家

663
00:45:00,890 --> 00:45:02,660
- Best of three? - That's what I'm thinking.
-三戰兩勝？ -我就是這樣想

664
00:45:02,860 --> 00:45:07,800
Should I use my invisibility to fight crime or for evil?
我應該運用我的隱形術 來打擊罪犯或是惡魔？

665
00:45:08,970 --> 00:45:11,400
- Serve the ball, chump. - "Serve the ball, chump."
-開球吧，木頭人 -「開球吧，木頭人」

666
00:45:11,600 --> 00:45:15,270
Okay, better comebacks, Mike. Better comebacks.
好的，重披戰袍會更好，麥克 重披戰袍會更好

667
00:45:19,140 --> 00:45:20,670
I got it!
我來接！

668
00:45:23,150 --> 00:45:25,450
I'm fine, by the way!
我沒事！

669
00:45:27,050 --> 00:45:29,750
I'm just saying, I have a cabin in the Adirondacks.
我是說我在阿爾剛金有間小木屋

670
00:45:29,960 --> 00:45:33,910
If you ever want to get away from the city, well, that'd be..
如果你有想要遠離塵囂 那會是…

671
00:45:34,590 --> 00:45:36,790
just nifty.
很不錯的

672
00:45:38,830 --> 00:45:43,770
Well, I've kind of got a lot on my plate right now.
嗯，我現在事情是蠻多的

673
00:45:43,940 --> 00:45:48,340
Not that I wouldn't love a weekend in the country with a strange man.
不是說我不喜歡 跟陌生男人到鄉間度週末

674
00:45:50,240 --> 00:45:53,080
- Jarvis? - Oh, you're back.
-傑維斯？ -喔，你回來了

675
00:45:54,280 --> 00:45:58,340
- This is my wife, Nancy. - Well, get out!
-這是我老婆，南西 -少來了！

676
00:45:59,950 --> 00:46:03,120
- Ross? Can I talk to you for a minute? - Yes, please.
-羅斯，我可以跟你談談嗎？ -當然了

677
00:46:07,730 --> 00:46:09,920
Is he still looking at me?
他還在看我嗎？

678
00:46:10,100 --> 00:46:11,460
Yes.
是的

679
00:46:13,070 --> 00:46:15,630
- Still? - Yes.
-還在看嗎？ -是的

680
00:46:15,800 --> 00:46:18,240
And his wife's kind of looking at me.
而他老婆好像是在看我

681
00:46:20,540 --> 00:46:23,370
So, what's going on?
發生什麼事呢？

682
00:46:25,280 --> 00:46:29,180
Well, Joey and I broke up.
嗯，喬伊跟我分手了

683
00:46:29,650 --> 00:46:35,050
- Oh, my God. What happened? - Joey is a great guy..
-我的天啊，發生了什麼事？ -喬伊是個好男人

684
00:46:35,220 --> 00:46:37,780
but we're just.. We're so different.
但是我們就是… 我們很不一樣了

685
00:46:37,960 --> 00:46:41,290
I mean, like, during your speech, he kept laughing at "Homo erectus."
就像是在你演講的時候 他一直在笑「直立人」

686
00:46:41,530 --> 00:46:43,960
I knew that was him!
我就知道是他！

687
00:46:45,560 --> 00:46:49,520
Anyway, I just.. I think it's for the best.
反正，我只是… 我想這樣是最好的

688
00:46:50,270 --> 00:46:54,800
- Hey. Hey, you okay? - I guess.
-嘿，你還好嗎？ -還好

689
00:46:57,040 --> 00:46:59,170
There was..
還有…

690
00:47:00,180 --> 00:47:05,310
There was another reason that I thought it was time to end it with Joey.
還有另外一個原因 讓我跟喬伊分手的

691
00:47:05,820 --> 00:47:11,950
I started to realize that I was having feelings for someone else.
我開始發覺 我對另外一個人有感覺

692
00:47:13,330 --> 00:47:16,120
Okay, Geller. Last day of the conference.
好的，蓋勒，研討會的最後一天了

693
00:47:16,330 --> 00:47:18,630
You know what happens to the keynote speaker.
你知道主講人會被怎樣的

694
00:47:18,830 --> 00:47:21,820
Professor Klarik, we're in the middle of a conversation here.
克雷克教授，我們正在談話當中

695
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:26,440
- Can't you throw him in the pool later? - Or we could throw you both in now.
-不能等會再丟他進游泳池嗎？ -或是把你們倆都丟進去

696
00:47:26,640 --> 00:47:30,070
Okay, gentlemen, please. Aren't we a little old for this?
男士們，拜託，我們會不會太老了呢？

697
00:47:30,240 --> 00:47:32,900
I mean, we're scientists, all right? We're academics..
我是說我們是科學家，好嗎？ 我們都有學術素養

698
00:47:33,080 --> 00:47:37,170
and most importantly, you will have to catch us first.
而且最重要的 你們必須要先捉住我們

699
00:47:37,350 --> 00:47:39,510
Go! Go! Go!
跑！跑！跑！

700
00:47:48,790 --> 00:47:51,230
Okay, so it's tied again, 41 to 41.
好的，又平手了，四十一比四十一

701
00:47:52,930 --> 00:47:56,130
- Okay, look, enough is enough. - No.
-好的，聽著，夠了 -不

702
00:47:56,340 --> 00:48:00,330
- I just have two more points to beat him. - Monica, that was also true an hour ago!
-我剩下兩分就可以打敗他了 -摩妮卡，一小時前你就這樣說了！

703
00:48:00,510 --> 00:48:02,100
I mean, please, look at you.
拜託，瞧瞧你自己

704
00:48:02,310 --> 00:48:06,770
Your hand is blistered, you can barely stand, your hair is inexplicable!
你的手都起水泡了，你連站都站不住 你的頭髮真是莫名奇妙！

705
00:48:08,680 --> 00:48:10,610
Phoebe, talk to Mike. Help me out.
菲比，去跟麥克說，幫忙我一下

706
00:48:10,780 --> 00:48:15,280
Mike, you win this, you will get the best sex you've ever had in your whole life.
麥克，只要你贏，你將會享受到 你從未享受過的性愛

707
00:48:18,060 --> 00:48:21,120
I say to fight crime.
好像是打擊罪犯比較好

708
00:48:30,970 --> 00:48:32,660
You didn't see us!
你沒有看到我們！

709
00:48:32,840 --> 00:48:34,670
Monica?
摩妮卡？

710
00:48:37,410 --> 00:48:40,810
You've already proven you're just as good as he is.
你已經證明你跟他一樣好了

711
00:48:40,980 --> 00:48:43,970
We missed our dinner reservations, so let's just go upstairs..
我們已經錯過晚餐預約 所以我們就上樓去…

712
00:48:44,150 --> 00:48:47,180
order room service, take a shower and shave your head!
點客房服務，洗個澡 然後剃光你的頭髮！

713
00:48:49,020 --> 00:48:52,050
I can't just walk away. I've put in four hours.
我不能這樣走掉 我已經投入四小時了

714
00:48:52,660 --> 00:48:54,720
You knew this about me when you married me.
當你娶我的時候 你就知道我是這樣的

715
00:48:54,890 --> 00:48:57,860
You agreed to take me in sickness and in health.
你答應無論我生病 或是健康都要照顧我的

716
00:48:58,030 --> 00:49:00,560
Well, this is my sickness!
這就是我的病！

717
00:49:00,800 --> 00:49:04,430
- What about the obsessive cleaning? - That's just good sense.
-那潔癖呢？ -那只是好習慣

718
00:49:12,340 --> 00:49:14,210
- You okay? - No, honey, I'm okay.
-你還好嗎？ -親愛的，我還好

719
00:49:14,410 --> 00:49:18,350
Shake it off. Oh, no shaking. No shaking. No shaking.
甩一甩，哎，不能甩 不能甩，不能甩

720
00:49:21,890 --> 00:49:25,410
Oh, my God. I can't play.
我的天，我不能玩了

721
00:49:25,620 --> 00:49:28,060
- So you forfeit? - Mike wins?
-所以你要棄權？ -麥克贏了嗎？

722
00:49:29,030 --> 00:49:32,460
I can't believe it. I lost.
我不敢相信，我輸了

723
00:49:35,730 --> 00:49:39,190
- No, you didn't. - What?
-不，你沒有 -什麼？

724
00:49:39,400 --> 00:49:42,530
- Because I'm gonna play for you. - You can't do that.
-因為我要幫你玩 -你不能這樣做

725
00:49:42,740 --> 00:49:46,040
It's okay. I don't care which of them I beat.
沒關係，我不在乎 到底是打敗他們其中哪個

726
00:49:46,780 --> 00:49:50,650
Okay, we're taking that paddle home, mister.
好的，我們要把 那個球拍帶回家，先生

727
00:49:54,150 --> 00:49:56,620
- Honey, you don't have to do this. - Yes, I do.
-親愛的，你沒有必要這樣做 -是的，我有必要

728
00:49:56,860 --> 00:49:59,120
I may not understand why you have to win so badly..
我或許無法理解 你為什麼一定要贏…

729
00:49:59,290 --> 00:50:01,890
but if it's important to you, it's important to me.
但是如果這對你很重要 對我就很重要

730
00:50:02,060 --> 00:50:03,720
Because I love you.
因為我愛你

731
00:50:04,630 --> 00:50:08,160
But you suck.
但是你很遜阿

732
00:50:09,400 --> 00:50:11,300
You're welcome, sweetheart.
不客氣，甜心

733
00:50:12,270 --> 00:50:14,670
All right, let's get this over with. Sudden death.
好的，我們快玩吧，快點受死

734
00:50:14,870 --> 00:50:18,780
- Whoever wins this point, wins. - Okay.
-贏得這一分的人就算贏了 -好的

